{"version":1,"content":"<p>阮小儀為HOY節目《他鄉的煮人2》作聲音導航，今天（26日）她在宣傳活動上透露，自參與過綜藝節目《美女廚神》，很多幕後人曾斟她主持煮食節目，但自認怕醜而婉拒：「每集節目都要煮幾味，都擔心自己能不能應付？</p><p>我寧願鼓勵大家簡單煮得開心就好！</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:56.513113+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:18:10.244390+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.819478+00:00","content_hash":"ae6e3dd06854cd56078bf93033894da59445833f388b5e14f0d695fd6a390dbc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}